# ----------------------------
# Roadmap / plan HTML derived views (spec: documentation-source-of-truth)
# Generated HTML views stay on-demand only. The interactive governance
# prototype below is tracked because it is a source artifact, not a derived view.
# ----------------------------
docs/plans/*.html
!docs/plans/ai-bim-governance-prototype.html

