# OpenSpec apply worktrees (opsx-worktree-provision)
# ----------------------------
.worktrees/
.superpowers/

# Ignore storage files by default
storage/*

# ----------------------------
# Local cleanup / scratch artifacts
# 本機暫存(cleanup patch、recovery log、備份、可重生的 Playwright 原始輸出)不入庫。
# 具名的 E2E 證據截圖(artifacts/e2e/*.png 等)仍依 artifacts/e2e/.gitignore 設計追蹤入庫。
# ----------------------------
artifacts/git-cleanup-*/
artifacts/*.patch
artifacts/*.txt
artifacts/preff-backup/
artifacts/e2e/_product_console_output/
artifacts/e2e/product-console-report/
# spec-to-done 執行期 state/log/pr-body 與設計期 readings/designs/verdicts(本機 scratch,可重生,不入庫)
artifacts/spec-to-done/
artifacts/spec-to-done-design/

